{"id":"gs09","类型":"讲义","科目":"高数","讲":"9","名称":"一元函数积分学的计算","简称":"","简介":"不定积分和定积分怎么算：凑微分、换元、分部、有理函数裂项，加上分段函数的原函数和反常积分。2010–2026 年 16 题 87 分；直接考的不算多，但第10–15讲的大题最后都要落到一个积分上。2010–2019 年 9 道真题都在这里。","intro":[],"sections":[{"id":"1","label":"节1","title":"基本积分表与凑微分","minutes":40,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：被积函数里藏着「一个函数和它的导数」，或者分母是不能分解的二次式。填空、选择 4–5 分，更是后面每道大题的基本动作。2010–2019 年没有单独考；2020 年以后考了 2 道。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"1-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int\\dfrac{x}{1+x^2}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac12\\ln(1+x^2)+C$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"分子 $x$ 差一个 2 就是分母的导数：$\\int\\dfrac{x}{1+x^2}dx=\\dfrac12\\int\\dfrac{d(1+x^2)}{1+x^2}=\\dfrac12\\ln(1+x^2)+C$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"1-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int\\dfrac{dx}{x^2+4x+8}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac12\\arctan\\frac{x+2}{2}+C$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"配方：$x^2+4x+8=(x+2)^2+4$。套 $\\int\\dfrac{du}{u^2+a^2}=\\dfrac1a\\arctan\\dfrac ua+C$，$u=x+2$，$a=2$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"不定积分就是求导倒过来"},{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int f(x)\\,dx$，就是找一个函数，它的导数等于 $f(x)$。所以第一件事是把求导表倒过来记熟：[[积分:pow|幂函数]]、[[积分:exp|指数函数]]、[[积分:trig|正弦余弦]]、[[积分:atan|反正切型]]、[[积分:asin|反正弦型]]。"},{"t":"p","text":"做完不定积分，求导验算一遍：导回去等于被积函数就对了。"},{"t":"h","text":"凑微分：找「一个函数和它的导数」"},{"t":"p","text":"被积式能写成 $g(\\varphi(x))\\cdot\\varphi'(x)$ 时，令 $u=\\varphi(x)$，$du=\\varphi'(x)\\,dx$，就变成 $\\int g(u)\\,du$。这是链式法则倒过来（公式本：[[积分:couwei|凑微分]]）。"},{"t":"p","text":"常见的「一对」：$\\dfrac{dx}{x}=d\\ln x$，$e^xdx=de^x$，$\\cos x\\,dx=d\\sin x$，$\\sec^2x\\,dx=d\\tan x$，$\\dfrac{dx}{1+x^2}=d\\arctan x$，$\\dfrac{dx}{\\sqrt x}=2\\,d\\sqrt x$，$x\\,dx=\\dfrac12d(x^2)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"三个「看到就想」："},{"t":"ul","items":["$\\dfrac{\\varphi'}{\\varphi}$ → $\\ln|\\varphi|$","$\\dfrac{\\varphi'}{1+\\varphi^2}$ → $\\arctan\\varphi$","$\\dfrac{\\varphi'}{\\sqrt{1-\\varphi^2}}$ → $\\arcsin\\varphi$"]},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"凑微分","body":[{"t":"p","text":"① 在被积式里找「复杂的那一块」$\\varphi(x)$：根号里、分母里、指数上、$\\ln$ 和反三角里面的东西。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 求 $\\varphi'(x)$，看被积式剩下的部分是不是它；差一个常数倍就在前面补上（$x\\,dx=\\frac12d(x^2)$）。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 令 $u=\\varphi(x)$，整个被积式只剩 $u$，不能还留着 $x$；查表积分。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 把 $u$ 换回 $\\varphi(x)$，加 $C$。拿不准就求导验算。"}]},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"分母是二次式，分子是一次式或常数","body":[{"t":"p","text":"① 先看分母能不能分解：能分解（判别式 $\\ge0$）就裂项，见 [[节4]]。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 不能分解：把分子拆成「分母导数的倍数 + 常数」。例如分母 $x^2+2x+5$，导数 $2x+2$：$2x+3=(2x+2)+1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 「分母导数」那一项积出 $\\ln(\\text{分母})$；常数那一项把分母配方成 $(x+m)^2+a^2$，积出 $\\dfrac1a\\arctan\\dfrac{x+m}a$（[[积分:atan|反正切型]]）。"}]},{"t":"box","kind":"why","label":"直觉","title":"","body":[{"t":"p","text":"凑微分的每一步都能倒回去验：$\\left[\\frac12\\ln(1+x^2)\\right]'=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac{2x}{1+x^2}=\\frac{x}{1+x^2}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"配方后的 $\\frac1a$ 从哪来：令 $x=at$，$\\dfrac{dx}{x^2+a^2}=\\dfrac{a\\,dt}{a^2(t^2+1)}=\\dfrac1a\\cdot\\dfrac{dt}{1+t^2}$。"}]},{"t":"ex","title":"凑微分","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int\\dfrac{dx}{x(1+\\ln^2x)}$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"复杂的一块是 $\\ln x$，它的导数 $\\frac1x$ 正好在被积式里。令 $u=\\ln x$，$du=\\frac{dx}x$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"原式 $=\\int\\dfrac{du}{1+u^2}=\\arctan u+C$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"换回 $x$：$\\arctan(\\ln x)+C$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"分子一次、分母二次","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_{-1}^{0}\\dfrac{x+3}{x^2+2x+2}\\,dx$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"分母判别式 $4-8<0$，不能分解。分母导数 $2x+2$：$x+3=\\frac12(2x+2)+2$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"第一项：$\\dfrac12\\int_{-1}^0\\dfrac{2x+2}{x^2+2x+2}dx=\\dfrac12\\ln(x^2+2x+2)\\Big|_{-1}^0=\\dfrac12(\\ln2-\\ln1)=\\dfrac12\\ln2$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"第二项：配方 $x^2+2x+2=(x+1)^2+1$，$2\\int_{-1}^0\\dfrac{dx}{(x+1)^2+1}=2\\arctan(x+1)\\Big|_{-1}^0=2\\cdot\\dfrac\\pi4=\\dfrac\\pi2$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"原式 $=\\dfrac12\\ln2+\\dfrac\\pi2$。"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["$\\int\\frac{dx}{x^2+4}$ 写成 $\\arctan\\frac x2+C$，丢了前面的 $\\frac12$。","换元只换了一半：$\\int xe^{x^2}dx$ 令 $u=x^2$ 后写成 $\\int e^u\\cdot x\\,du$，$x$ 和 $u$ 混在一起。应该是 $x\\,dx=\\frac12du$。","分母是 $(x+1)^2+4$，配方后写成 $\\arctan(x+1)$。应该是 $\\frac12\\arctan\\frac{x+1}2$。","分子拆完只积了 $\\ln$ 那一项，常数那一项忘了。","不定积分漏 $+C$。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"1-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int x\\sqrt{1+x^2}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac13(1+x^2)^{\\frac32}+C$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$x\\,dx=\\frac12d(1+x^2)$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 令 $u=1+x^2$，$du=2x\\,dx$，所以 $x\\,dx=\\frac12du$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 原式 $=\\dfrac12\\int\\sqrt u\\,du=\\dfrac12\\cdot\\dfrac23u^{\\frac32}+C=\\dfrac13u^{\\frac32}+C$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 换回 $x$：$\\dfrac13(1+x^2)^{\\frac32}+C$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 求导验算：$\\dfrac13\\cdot\\dfrac32(1+x^2)^{\\frac12}\\cdot2x=x\\sqrt{1+x^2}$，对。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"根号里是 $1+x^2$，它的导数 $2x$ 和外面的 $x$ 只差常数 → 凑微分，令 $u=1+x^2$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"1-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int\\dfrac{e^x}{1+e^{2x}}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\arctan e^x+C$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$e^{2x}=(e^x)^2$，$e^xdx=d(e^x)$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 令 $u=e^x$，$du=e^xdx$，分母 $1+e^{2x}=1+u^2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 原式 $=\\int\\dfrac{du}{1+u^2}=\\arctan u+C$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 换回 $x$：$\\arctan e^x+C$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"分母是 $1+(e^x)^2$，分子 $e^x$ 正好是 $e^x$ 的导数 → $\\frac{\\varphi'}{1+\\varphi^2}$ 型，积出 $\\arctan\\varphi$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"1-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int\\dfrac{dx}{\\sqrt x\\,(1+x)}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$2\\arctan\\sqrt x+C$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt x}=2\\,d\\sqrt x$，而 $x=(\\sqrt x)^2$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $(\\sqrt x)'=\\dfrac1{2\\sqrt x}$，所以 $\\dfrac{dx}{\\sqrt x}=2\\,d\\sqrt x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 令 $u=\\sqrt x$，$1+x=1+u^2$：原式 $=\\int\\dfrac{2\\,du}{1+u^2}=2\\arctan u+C$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 换回 $x$：$2\\arctan\\sqrt x+C$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"看到 $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt x}$ 就想到 $d\\sqrt x$；分母剩下的 $1+x=1+(\\sqrt x)^2$ → $\\arctan$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"1-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int\\dfrac{2x+3}{x^2+2x+5}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\ln(x^2+2x+5)+\\frac12\\arctan\\frac{x+1}2+C$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"分母不能分解；分母的导数是 $2x+2$，分子拆成 $(2x+2)+1$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"第二项配方：$x^2+2x+5=(x+1)^2+4$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 判别式 $4-20<0$，分母不能分解。分母导数 $2x+2$，$2x+3=(2x+2)+1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 第一项：$\\int\\dfrac{2x+2}{x^2+2x+5}dx=\\ln(x^2+2x+5)$。分母恒正，不用加绝对值。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 第二项：$\\int\\dfrac{dx}{(x+1)^2+4}=\\dfrac12\\arctan\\dfrac{x+1}2$（$a=2$）。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 相加：$\\ln(x^2+2x+5)+\\dfrac12\\arctan\\dfrac{x+1}2+C$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"分子一次、分母是不能分解的二次式 → 分子拆成「分母导数 + 常数」，一项积出 $\\ln$，一项配方积出 $\\arctan$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"1-p5","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^1\\dfrac{x}{x^2+x+1}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac12\\ln3-\\frac{\\sqrt3\\pi}{18}$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"分母导数是 $2x+1$：$x=\\frac12(2x+1)-\\frac12$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$x^2+x+1=\\left(x+\\frac12\\right)^2+\\frac34$，$a=\\frac{\\sqrt3}2$；$\\arctan\\frac{2x+1}{\\sqrt3}$ 在 $x=1$、$x=0$ 处分别是 $\\frac\\pi3$、$\\frac\\pi6$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 分母导数 $2x+1$：$x=\\dfrac12(2x+1)-\\dfrac12$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 第一项：$\\dfrac12\\int_0^1\\dfrac{2x+1}{x^2+x+1}dx=\\dfrac12\\ln(x^2+x+1)\\Big|_0^1=\\dfrac12\\ln3$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 第二项先配方：$x^2+x+1=\\left(x+\\frac12\\right)^2+\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt3}2\\right)^2$，$a=\\frac{\\sqrt3}2$，$\\frac1a=\\frac2{\\sqrt3}$，$\\frac{x+\\frac12}{a}=\\frac{2x+1}{\\sqrt3}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $\\int_0^1\\dfrac{dx}{\\left(x+\\frac12\\right)^2+\\frac34}=\\dfrac2{\\sqrt3}\\arctan\\dfrac{2x+1}{\\sqrt3}\\Big|_0^1=\\dfrac2{\\sqrt3}\\left(\\dfrac\\pi3-\\dfrac\\pi6\\right)=\\dfrac{\\pi}{3\\sqrt3}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3\\pi}9$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 原式 $=\\dfrac12\\ln3-\\dfrac12\\cdot\\dfrac{\\sqrt3\\pi}9=\\dfrac12\\ln3-\\dfrac{\\sqrt3\\pi}{18}$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"分母判别式 $1-4<0$，不能分解 → 分子拆成「分母导数的倍数 + 常数」。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"分数套分数最容易错：先把 $a$ 单独写出来，再代进 $\\frac1a\\arctan\\frac{x+m}a$。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"later","text":"2020 年以后本节考过：2020-3（凑微分 $u=\\arcsin\\sqrt x$）、2022-13（分子拆成分母导数 + 常数）。"},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"不定积分 → 先问能不能直接查表 → 不能就找「一个函数和它的导数」凑微分（差常数倍补上，换元后不许留 $x$）→ 分子一次、分母二次不能分解：拆成「分母导数 + 常数」，一项 $\\ln$、一项配方 $\\arctan$，别丢 $\\frac1a$。"}]}]},{"id":"2","label":"节2","title":"换元：去根号、换上下限、用对称","minutes":45,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：被积函数里有根号，换元去掉；定积分换元时上下限一起换；对称区间先看奇偶；被积函数分段时先看哪段不为 0。填空 4–5 分。2010–2019 年 1 道（2011-12）；2021 年又考了一道。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"2-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_{-1}^{1}x^3\\cos x\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$0$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$(-x)^3\\cos(-x)=-x^3\\cos x$，被积函数是奇函数，在对称区间 $[-1,1]$ 上积分为 0。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"2-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^4\\dfrac{dx}{1+\\sqrt x}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$4-2\\ln3$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"令 $t=\\sqrt x$，$x=t^2$，$dx=2t\\,dt$；$x$ 从 0 到 4 时 $t$ 从 0 到 2。"},{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_0^2\\dfrac{2t}{1+t}dt=2\\int_0^2\\left(1-\\dfrac1{1+t}\\right)dt=2\\big[t-\\ln(1+t)\\big]_0^2=4-2\\ln3$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"第二类换元：主动令 x 等于新变量的函数"},{"t":"p","text":"凑微分是「看出 $u=\\varphi(x)$」；第二类换元是「主动令 $x=\\psi(t)$」，目的几乎都是去根号。"},{"t":"ul","items":["$\\sqrt[n]{ax+b}$：令 $t=\\sqrt[n]{ax+b}$，解出 $x=\\dfrac{t^n-b}{a}$。","$\\sqrt{e^x-1}$：令 $t=\\sqrt{e^x-1}$，$x=\\ln(1+t^2)$。","$\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}$：令 $x=a\\sin t$，根号变成 $a\\cos t$。","$\\sqrt{a^2+x^2}$：令 $x=a\\tan t$，根号变成 $a\\sec t$。","$\\sqrt{x^2-a^2}$：令 $x=a\\sec t$，根号变成 $a\\tan t$。"]},{"t":"p","text":"后三行是三角代换（公式本：[[积分:sub|三角代换]]）。"},{"t":"h","text":"定积分的三件省力工具"},{"t":"ul","items":["换元必换限：令 $x=\\psi(t)$ 后，上下限换成 $t$ 的上下限，算完**不用换回** $x$。","对称区间（[[积分:sym|对称区间]]）：奇函数积分为 0，偶函数取 $[0,a]$ 再乘 2；不奇不偶就用 $\\int_{-a}^af(x)dx=\\int_0^a[f(x)+f(-x)]dx$。","$\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi2}\\sin^nx\\,dx$、$\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi2}\\cos^nx\\,dx$：[[积分:wallis|点火公式]]。另有 [[积分:reflect|区间再现]]，令 $x=a+b-t$，两式相加消掉难算的部分。"]},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"定积分换元","body":[{"t":"p","text":"① 选换元：去根号（$t=\\sqrt{\\cdots}$ 或三角代换），或者把参数提出去（$t=\\lambda x$）。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 写三样：$x=\\psi(t)$、$dx=\\psi'(t)\\,dt$、新的上下限。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 代进去，整个积分只剩 $t$，算出来就是答案，不用换回。"}]},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"对称区间、分段的被积函数","body":[{"t":"p","text":"① 区间关于 0 对称 → 先把被积函数拆成奇部分和偶部分：奇的积分为 0，偶的取 $[0,a]$ 再乘 2。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 含 $|x|$ → 用偶性去掉绝对值，或者按正负分段。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 被积函数分段定义、某段为 0 → 先划掉为 0 的那段，只积真正不为 0 的区间。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $[0,\\frac\\pi2]$ 上的 $\\sin^n$、$\\cos^n$ → 点火公式。"}]},{"t":"box","kind":"why","label":"直觉","title":"","body":[{"t":"p","text":"奇函数的图像关于原点对称：$[-a,0]$ 上的面积和 $[0,a]$ 上的大小相等、符号相反，加起来是 0。"},{"t":"p","text":"换元必换限：$\\int_0^4\\frac{dx}{1+\\sqrt x}$ 令 $t=\\sqrt x$ 后，$t$ 只从 0 走到 2；还写 $\\int_0^4$，就等于让 $x$ 走到了 16。"}]},{"t":"ex","title":"三角代换 + 点火公式","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^1x^2\\sqrt{1-x^2}\\,dx$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"看到 $\\sqrt{1-x^2}$ → 令 $x=\\sin t$，$dx=\\cos t\\,dt$；$x$ 从 0 到 1 时 $t$ 从 0 到 $\\frac\\pi2$；这时 $\\cos t\\ge0$，$\\sqrt{1-x^2}=\\cos t$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"原式 $=\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi2}\\sin^2t\\cos^2t\\,dt=\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi2}\\left(\\sin^2t-\\sin^4t\\right)dt$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"点火公式：$\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi2}\\sin^2t\\,dt=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac\\pi2=\\frac\\pi4$，$\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi2}\\sin^4t\\,dt=\\frac34\\cdot\\frac12\\cdot\\frac\\pi2=\\frac{3\\pi}{16}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"原式 $=\\dfrac\\pi4-\\dfrac{3\\pi}{16}=\\dfrac{\\pi}{16}$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"对称区间","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_{-1}^{1}\\dfrac{(1+x)^2}{1+x^2}\\,dx$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"展开分子：$\\dfrac{(1+x)^2}{1+x^2}=\\dfrac{1+x^2+2x}{1+x^2}=1+\\dfrac{2x}{1+x^2}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$\\dfrac{2x}{1+x^2}$ 是奇函数，在 $[-1,1]$ 上积分为 0。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"原式 $=\\int_{-1}^11\\,dx=2$。"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["定积分换元后还用原来的上下限。","三角代换后把 $\\sqrt{\\cos^2t}$ 直接写成 $\\cos t$，没看 $t$ 的范围；$t\\in[0,\\frac\\pi2]$ 时才可以。","奇偶看错：$x^2\\sin x$ 是奇函数（偶 × 奇），$x\\sin x$ 是偶函数（奇 × 奇）。","被积函数在 $x\\le0$ 时为 0，还对整个 $(-\\infty,+\\infty)$ 积。","根式代换求不定积分，最后忘了把 $t$ 换回 $x$。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"2-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}\\left(x^2\\sin x+\\cos^2x\\right)dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\pi$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"拆成两项：$x^2\\sin x$ 是奇函数还是偶函数？"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$\\cos^2x=\\frac{1+\\cos2x}2$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $x^2\\sin x$：偶函数乘奇函数，是奇函数，在 $[-\\pi,\\pi]$ 上积分为 0。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $\\cos^2x=\\dfrac{1+\\cos2x}2$：$\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}\\cos^2x\\,dx=\\dfrac12\\cdot2\\pi+\\dfrac14\\sin2x\\Big|_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}=\\pi+0=\\pi$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 原式 $=0+\\pi=\\pi$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"积分区间关于 0 对称 → 先把奇函数那项划掉，再算剩下的。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"2-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^{3}\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{1+x}}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac83$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"令 $t=\\sqrt{1+x}$，$x=t^2-1$，$dx=2t\\,dt$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"新的上下限：$t$ 从 1 到 2。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 令 $t=\\sqrt{1+x}$，$x=t^2-1$，$dx=2t\\,dt$；$x=0$ 时 $t=1$，$x=3$ 时 $t=2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 原式 $=\\int_1^2\\dfrac{t^2-1}{t}\\cdot2t\\,dt=2\\int_1^2(t^2-1)\\,dt$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $2\\left[\\dfrac{t^3}3-t\\right]_1^2=2\\left[\\left(\\dfrac83-2\\right)-\\left(\\dfrac13-1\\right)\\right]=2\\left(\\dfrac23+\\dfrac23\\right)=\\dfrac83$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"被积函数里有 $\\sqrt{1+x}$ → 令 $t$ 等于整个根号，去根号；定积分换元，上下限一起换。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"2-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^1\\dfrac{dx}{(1+x^2)^{\\frac32}}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac{\\sqrt2}2$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"看到 $1+x^2$ 开方 → 令 $x=\\tan t$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$dx=\\sec^2t\\,dt$，$(1+x^2)^{\\frac32}=\\sec^3t$，$t$ 从 0 到 $\\frac\\pi4$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 令 $x=\\tan t$，$dx=\\sec^2t\\,dt$；$x=0$ 时 $t=0$，$x=1$ 时 $t=\\frac\\pi4$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $1+x^2=\\sec^2t$，$t\\in[0,\\frac\\pi4]$ 时 $\\sec t>0$，所以 $(1+x^2)^{\\frac32}=\\sec^3t$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 原式 $=\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi4}\\dfrac{\\sec^2t}{\\sec^3t}dt=\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi4}\\cos t\\,dt=\\sin t\\Big|_0^{\\frac\\pi4}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"$(1+x^2)^{\\frac32}=\\left(\\sqrt{1+x^2}\\right)^3$，是 $\\sqrt{a^2+x^2}$ 型 → 令 $x=\\tan t$，用 $1+\\tan^2t=\\sec^2t$ 去根号。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"2-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int\\dfrac{dx}{1+\\sqrt[3]{x}}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac32x^{\\frac23}-3\\sqrt[3]x+3\\ln\\left|1+\\sqrt[3]x\\right|+C$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"令 $t=\\sqrt[3]x$，$x=t^3$，$dx=3t^2dt$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$\\dfrac{t^2}{1+t}=t-1+\\dfrac1{1+t}$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 令 $t=\\sqrt[3]x$，$x=t^3$，$dx=3t^2dt$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 原式 $=\\int\\dfrac{3t^2}{1+t}dt$。分子次数高，先除：$t^2=(t-1)(t+1)+1$，所以 $\\dfrac{t^2}{1+t}=t-1+\\dfrac1{1+t}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $3\\int\\left(t-1+\\dfrac1{1+t}\\right)dt=\\dfrac32t^2-3t+3\\ln|1+t|+C$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 换回 $x$（$t^2=x^{\\frac23}$）：$\\dfrac32x^{\\frac23}-3\\sqrt[3]x+3\\ln\\left|1+\\sqrt[3]x\\right|+C$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"有 $\\sqrt[3]x$ → 令 $t=\\sqrt[3]x$ 去根号；变成有理函数后先做除法。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"2-p5","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $f(x)=\\begin{cases}xe^{-x^2},&x\\ge0,\\\\[2pt]\\dfrac{1}{1+\\cos x},&-\\pi<x<0,\\end{cases}$ 求 $\\int_1^4f(x-2)\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\tan\\frac12+\\frac12-\\frac12e^{-4}$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"令 $t=x-2$，积分变成 $\\int_{-1}^{2}f(t)\\,dt$，在 $t=0$ 处拆开。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$1+\\cos t=2\\cos^2\\frac t2$，$\\int\\dfrac{dt}{2\\cos^2\\frac t2}=\\tan\\dfrac t2+C$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 令 $t=x-2$，$dx=dt$；$x=1$ 时 $t=-1$，$x=4$ 时 $t=2$。原式 $=\\int_{-1}^2f(t)\\,dt=\\int_{-1}^0\\dfrac{dt}{1+\\cos t}+\\int_0^2te^{-t^2}dt$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 第一段：$1+\\cos t=2\\cos^2\\dfrac t2$，$\\int_{-1}^0\\dfrac{dt}{2\\cos^2\\frac t2}=\\tan\\dfrac t2\\Big|_{-1}^0=0-\\tan\\left(-\\dfrac12\\right)=\\tan\\dfrac12$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 第二段：$te^{-t^2}dt=-\\dfrac12d\\left(e^{-t^2}\\right)$，$\\int_0^2te^{-t^2}dt=-\\dfrac12e^{-t^2}\\Big|_0^2=\\dfrac12-\\dfrac12e^{-4}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=\\tan\\dfrac12+\\dfrac12-\\dfrac12e^{-4}$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"被积函数是 $f(x-2)$ 而 $f$ 分段 → 先换元 $t=x-2$ 让 $f$ 的自变量变简单，再按分段点 0 拆开分别积。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2011-12","src":{"year":2011,"no":12,"score":4,"type":"填空"},"type":"填空","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设函数 $f(x)=\\begin{cases}\\lambda e^{-\\lambda x},&x>0,\\\\0,&x\\le 0,\\end{cases}\\ \\lambda>0$，则 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}xf(x)\\,dx=$____。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\dfrac1\\lambda$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$x\\le0$ 时 $f(x)=0$，先划掉这一段。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"令 $t=\\lambda x$ 把 $\\lambda$ 提出去；$\\int_0^{+\\infty}te^{-t}\\,dt$ 用分部积分（[[节3]]）。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $x\\le0$ 时 $xf(x)=0$，所以原式 $=\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\lambda xe^{-\\lambda x}dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 令 $t=\\lambda x$（$\\lambda>0$），$x=\\dfrac t\\lambda$，$dx=\\dfrac{dt}\\lambda$；$x$ 从 0 到 $+\\infty$ 时 $t$ 也从 0 到 $+\\infty$。原式 $=\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\lambda\\cdot\\dfrac t\\lambda e^{-t}\\cdot\\dfrac{dt}\\lambda=\\dfrac1\\lambda\\int_0^{+\\infty}te^{-t}dt$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 分部积分：$\\int te^{-t}dt=-te^{-t}+\\int e^{-t}dt=-(t+1)e^{-t}+C$。$t\\to+\\infty$ 时 $(t+1)e^{-t}\\to0$，所以 $\\int_0^{+\\infty}te^{-t}dt=0-(-1)=1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=\\dfrac1\\lambda$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"被积函数分段、一段为 0 → 先划掉为 0 的部分；剩下的含参数 $\\lambda$，换元 $t=\\lambda x$ 把参数提出去。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"常用结论 $\\int_0^{+\\infty}t^ne^{-t}dt=n!$，$n=1$ 就是这里的 1。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"later","text":"2020 年以后本节考过：2021-11（对称区间上的偶函数，取 2 倍后凑微分）。"},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"有根号 → 换元去根号（$t=\\sqrt{\\cdots}$ 或三角代换）→ 定积分换元：$x$、$dx$、上下限三样一起换，算完不用换回 → 对称区间先划掉奇函数 → 分段的被积函数先划掉为 0 的段 → $[0,\\frac\\pi2]$ 上的 $\\sin^n$、$\\cos^n$ 用点火公式。"}]}]},{"id":"3","label":"节3","title":"分部积分","minutes":45,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：被积函数是两类函数的乘积（多项式 × 指数或三角，指数 × 反三角），或者单独一个 $\\ln$、反三角。解答题 10 分，也常是大题里的一步。2010–2019 年 1 道（2018-15）。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"3-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int xe^x\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$(x-1)e^x+C$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$u=x$，$dv=e^xdx$，$v=e^x$：$\\int xe^xdx=xe^x-\\int e^xdx=xe^x-e^x+C=(x-1)e^x+C$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"3-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int\\ln x\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$x\\ln x-x+C$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"只有一个函数，把 $dx$ 当 $dv$：$u=\\ln x$，$v=x$。$\\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-\\int x\\cdot\\dfrac1x\\,dx=x\\ln x-x+C$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"乘积求导倒过来"},{"t":"p","text":"$(uv)'=u'v+uv'$ 两边积分、移项，就是 $\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du$（公式本：[[积分:parts|分部积分]]）。"},{"t":"p","text":"分部积分做的事：对 $u$ 求导，对 $dv$ 积分。所以要选**求导后变简单**的当 $u$，**积分后不变复杂**的放进 $dv$。"},{"t":"p","text":"选 $u$ 的顺序「反对幂指三」：反三角、对数最优先当 $u$（求导后变成代数式），其次是幂函数（多项式），指数、三角留给 $dv$。"},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"分部积分","body":[{"t":"p","text":"① 认出乘积里的两类函数，按「反对幂指三」排：排在前面的当 $u$，后面的和 $dx$ 一起当 $dv$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 只有一个函数（$\\ln x$、$\\arctan x$）→ 它当 $u$，$dv=dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 先写出 $v$ 和 $du$，再代进 $\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 剩下的 $\\int v\\,du$：多项式次数降了一次，就对它重复分部；又出现了原积分（$e^x\\sin x$ 型），就移项解方程。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 定积分：$uv\\Big|_a^b-\\int_a^bv\\,du$，边界项先算出数。"}]},{"t":"box","kind":"why","label":"直觉","title":"","body":[{"t":"p","text":"为什么 $xe^x$ 要让 $x$ 当 $u$：$x$ 求导变成 1，$e^x$ 积分还是 $e^x$，剩下 $\\int e^xdx$ 一步就完。"},{"t":"p","text":"反过来让 $e^x$ 当 $u$：$\\int xe^xdx=\\dfrac{x^2}2e^x-\\int\\dfrac{x^2}2e^xdx$，次数升了，越积越难。"}]},{"t":"ex","title":"两次分部","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^1x^2e^{x}\\,dx$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"$u=x^2$，$dv=e^xdx$，$v=e^x$：$\\int_0^1x^2e^xdx=x^2e^x\\Big|_0^1-2\\int_0^1xe^xdx=e-2\\int_0^1xe^xdx$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"再分部一次：$\\int_0^1xe^xdx=(x-1)e^x\\Big|_0^1=0-(-1)=1$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"原式 $=e-2$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"循环型","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"记 $I=\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx$。$u=\\sin x$，$dv=e^xdx$：$I=e^x\\sin x-\\int e^x\\cos x\\,dx$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"再分部，仍让三角当 $u$：$\\int e^x\\cos x\\,dx=e^x\\cos x+\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx=e^x\\cos x+I$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"代回：$I=e^x\\sin x-e^x\\cos x-I$，移项 $2I=e^x(\\sin x-\\cos x)$，$I=\\dfrac12e^x(\\sin x-\\cos x)+C$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"反三角","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^1\\arctan x\\,dx$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"只有一个函数：$u=\\arctan x$，$dv=dx$，$v=x$，$du=\\dfrac{dx}{1+x^2}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_0^1\\arctan x\\,dx=x\\arctan x\\Big|_0^1-\\int_0^1\\dfrac{x}{1+x^2}dx=\\dfrac\\pi4-\\dfrac12\\ln(1+x^2)\\Big|_0^1=\\dfrac\\pi4-\\dfrac12\\ln2$。"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["$u$、$dv$ 选反：$\\int x\\ln x\\,dx$ 让 $x$ 当 $u$，就得去积 $\\ln x$，更难。「对」排在「幂」前面，应该 $u=\\ln x$。","$-\\int v\\,du$ 的负号丢了，或者第二次分部时负号没跟着变。","循环型两次分部选的 $u$ 不一致（第一次三角当 $u$，第二次换成指数当 $u$），绕回来变成 $I=I$。","定积分分部，边界项 $uv\\big|_a^b$ 没代上下限就当成 0。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"3-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int x\\ln x\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac{x^2}2\\ln x-\\frac{x^2}4+C$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"「对」在「幂」前面：$u=\\ln x$，$dv=x\\,dx$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $u=\\ln x$，$dv=x\\,dx$，$v=\\dfrac{x^2}2$，$du=\\dfrac{dx}x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $\\int x\\ln x\\,dx=\\dfrac{x^2}2\\ln x-\\int\\dfrac{x^2}2\\cdot\\dfrac1x\\,dx=\\dfrac{x^2}2\\ln x-\\int\\dfrac x2\\,dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $=\\dfrac{x^2}2\\ln x-\\dfrac{x^2}4+C$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"幂函数乘对数 → 分部，对数当 $u$（求导后变成 $\\frac1x$，和幂函数约掉）。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"3-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^{\\pi}x\\sin x\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\pi$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$u=x$，$dv=\\sin x\\,dx$，$v=-\\cos x$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $u=x$，$dv=\\sin x\\,dx$，$v=-\\cos x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $\\int_0^\\pi x\\sin x\\,dx=-x\\cos x\\Big|_0^\\pi+\\int_0^\\pi\\cos x\\,dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 边界项：$-\\pi\\cos\\pi-0=\\pi$；$\\int_0^\\pi\\cos x\\,dx=\\sin x\\Big|_0^\\pi=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=\\pi$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"多项式乘三角 → 分部，多项式当 $u$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"3-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int x\\arctan x\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac{x^2+1}2\\arctan x-\\frac x2+C$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$u=\\arctan x$，$dv=x\\,dx$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"剩下 $\\int\\dfrac{x^2}{1+x^2}dx$，把分子写成 $(1+x^2)-1$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $u=\\arctan x$，$dv=x\\,dx$，$v=\\dfrac{x^2}2$，$du=\\dfrac{dx}{1+x^2}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 原式 $=\\dfrac{x^2}2\\arctan x-\\dfrac12\\int\\dfrac{x^2}{1+x^2}dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $\\dfrac{x^2}{1+x^2}=1-\\dfrac1{1+x^2}$，积分得 $x-\\arctan x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=\\dfrac{x^2}2\\arctan x-\\dfrac12x+\\dfrac12\\arctan x+C=\\dfrac{x^2+1}2\\arctan x-\\dfrac x2+C$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"幂函数乘反三角 → 分部，反三角当 $u$。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"一开始就取 $v=\\dfrac{x^2+1}2$（也是 $x$ 的原函数），$v\\,du=\\dfrac12dx$，一步就完。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"3-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^1e^{\\sqrt x}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$2$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"先令 $t=\\sqrt x$ 去根号：$dx=2t\\,dt$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"变成 $2\\int_0^1te^tdt$，再分部。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 令 $t=\\sqrt x$，$x=t^2$，$dx=2t\\,dt$；$t$ 从 0 到 1。原式 $=2\\int_0^1te^tdt$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 分部：$\\int te^tdt=(t-1)e^t+C$，$\\int_0^1te^tdt=0-(-1)=1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 原式 $=2\\times1=2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"有根号先换元；换完是多项式乘指数，再分部。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"3-p5","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int\\dfrac{\\ln(1+x)}{\\sqrt x}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$2\\sqrt x\\ln(1+x)-4\\sqrt x+4\\arctan\\sqrt x+C$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"对数当 $u$：$u=\\ln(1+x)$，$dv=\\dfrac{dx}{\\sqrt x}$，$v=2\\sqrt x$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"剩下 $\\int\\dfrac{2\\sqrt x}{1+x}dx$，令 $t=\\sqrt x$，化成 $4\\int\\dfrac{t^2}{1+t^2}dt$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $u=\\ln(1+x)$，$du=\\dfrac{dx}{1+x}$；$dv=\\dfrac{dx}{\\sqrt x}$，$v=2\\sqrt x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 原式 $=2\\sqrt x\\ln(1+x)-\\int\\dfrac{2\\sqrt x}{1+x}dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 令 $t=\\sqrt x$，$dx=2t\\,dt$：$\\int\\dfrac{2\\sqrt x}{1+x}dx=\\int\\dfrac{2t}{1+t^2}\\cdot2t\\,dt=4\\int\\dfrac{t^2}{1+t^2}dt=4\\int\\left(1-\\dfrac1{1+t^2}\\right)dt=4t-4\\arctan t+C$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 换回 $x$ 并代入：原式 $=2\\sqrt x\\ln(1+x)-4\\sqrt x+4\\arctan\\sqrt x+C$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"对数乘幂函数（$x^{-\\frac12}$）→ 分部，对数当 $u$；剩下的积分带根号，再换元。和 2018-15 是同一个结构：先分部，再根式代换。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2018-15","src":{"year":2018,"no":15,"score":10,"type":"解答"},"type":"解答","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求不定积分 $\\int e^{2x}\\arctan\\sqrt{e^x-1}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac12e^{2x}\\arctan\\sqrt{e^x-1}-\\frac16(e^x-1)^{\\frac32}-\\frac12\\sqrt{e^x-1}+C$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"反三角当 $u=\\arctan\\sqrt{e^x-1}$，$dv=e^{2x}dx$，$v=\\frac12e^{2x}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$1+\\left(\\sqrt{e^x-1}\\right)^2=e^x$，所以 $du=\\dfrac{dx}{2\\sqrt{e^x-1}}$；剩下的积分令 $t=\\sqrt{e^x-1}$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 取 $u=\\arctan\\sqrt{e^x-1}$，$dv=e^{2x}dx$，$v=\\dfrac12e^{2x}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 求 $du$：$\\left(\\sqrt{e^x-1}\\right)'=\\dfrac{e^x}{2\\sqrt{e^x-1}}$，$1+\\left(\\sqrt{e^x-1}\\right)^2=e^x$，所以 $du=\\dfrac1{e^x}\\cdot\\dfrac{e^x}{2\\sqrt{e^x-1}}dx=\\dfrac{dx}{2\\sqrt{e^x-1}}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 分部：原式 $=\\dfrac12e^{2x}\\arctan\\sqrt{e^x-1}-\\int\\dfrac12e^{2x}\\cdot\\dfrac{dx}{2\\sqrt{e^x-1}}=\\dfrac12e^{2x}\\arctan\\sqrt{e^x-1}-\\dfrac14\\int\\dfrac{e^{2x}}{\\sqrt{e^x-1}}dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 剩下的积分令 $t=\\sqrt{e^x-1}$：$e^x=1+t^2$，$x=\\ln(1+t^2)$，$dx=\\dfrac{2t}{1+t^2}dt$。$\\int\\dfrac{e^{2x}}{\\sqrt{e^x-1}}dx=\\int\\dfrac{(1+t^2)^2}{t}\\cdot\\dfrac{2t}{1+t^2}dt=2\\int(1+t^2)\\,dt=2t+\\dfrac23t^3+C$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 代回：原式 $=\\dfrac12e^{2x}\\arctan\\sqrt{e^x-1}-\\dfrac14\\left(2t+\\dfrac23t^3\\right)+C=\\dfrac12e^{2x}\\arctan\\sqrt{e^x-1}-\\dfrac16(e^x-1)^{\\frac32}-\\dfrac12\\sqrt{e^x-1}+C$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"指数乘反三角 → 分部，反三角当 $u$（求导后变成代数式），$e^{2x}$ 放进 $dv$；剩下带根号的积分再用根式代换。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"也可以一开始就令 $t=\\sqrt{e^x-1}$：$e^{2x}dx=2t(1+t^2)\\,dt$，化成 $\\int2t(1+t^2)\\arctan t\\,dt$ 再分部，结果一样。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"两类函数相乘 → 分部，「反对幂指三」靠前的当 $u$ → 只有 $\\ln$ 或反三角也分部，$dv=dx$ → 多项式几次就分部几次 → $e^x$ 乘三角：两次分部、$u$ 选同一类，出现原积分就移项 → 有根号先换元，再分部。"}]}]},{"id":"4","label":"节4","title":"有理函数的积分：裂项","minutes":50,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：被积函数是两个多项式相除，分母能分解。解答题 10 分（分母有重根和二次因子），也藏在反常积分的填空里（[[节6]]）。2010–2019 年 1 道（2019-16）；2025 年又考了一道大题。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"4-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"把 $\\dfrac{1}{x^2-1}$ 拆成部分分式，并求 $\\int\\dfrac{dx}{x^2-1}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac1{x^2-1}=\\frac12\\left(\\frac1{x-1}-\\frac1{x+1}\\right)$，积分为 $\\frac12\\ln\\left|\\frac{x-1}{x+1}\\right|+C$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\dfrac1{(x-1)(x+1)}=\\dfrac A{x-1}+\\dfrac B{x+1}$，两边乘分母：$1=A(x+1)+B(x-1)$。代 $x=1$ 得 $A=\\frac12$，代 $x=-1$ 得 $B=-\\frac12$。"},{"t":"p","text":"积分：$\\dfrac12\\ln|x-1|-\\dfrac12\\ln|x+1|+C=\\dfrac12\\ln\\left|\\dfrac{x-1}{x+1}\\right|+C$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"4-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\dfrac{x+2}{x(x+1)^2}$ 应该设成什么形式？只写形式，不用求系数。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac Ax+\\frac B{x+1}+\\frac C{(x+1)^2}$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$x$ 是一次因子，设一项 $\\frac Ax$；$(x+1)^2$ 是重复两次的一次因子，从 1 次设到 2 次：$\\frac B{x+1}+\\frac C{(x+1)^2}$，两项都要。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"拆成能直接积的小分式"},{"t":"p","text":"分母能分解，就能把一个复杂的分式拆成几个简单分式的和，每个都能直接积。按分母里的因子设："},{"t":"ul","items":["一次因子 $x-a$：设 $\\dfrac{A}{x-a}$。","重复两次 $(x-a)^2$：设 $\\dfrac{A}{x-a}+\\dfrac{B}{(x-a)^2}$。","重复三次 $(x-a)^3$：设 $\\dfrac{A}{x-a}+\\dfrac{B}{(x-a)^2}+\\dfrac{C}{(x-a)^3}$。","不能分解的二次因子 $x^2+px+q$（$p^2<4q$）：设 $\\dfrac{Bx+C}{x^2+px+q}$。"]},{"t":"p","text":"拆完每一项都会积：$\\int\\dfrac{A}{x-a}dx=A\\ln|x-a|$；$\\int\\dfrac{B}{(x-a)^2}dx=-\\dfrac{B}{x-a}$；二次因子那项按 [[节1]] 拆成「分母导数 + 常数」。公式本：[[积分:rational|有理函数拆分]]。"},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"有理函数积分五步","body":[{"t":"p","text":"① 假分式（分子次数 $\\ge$ 分母次数）先做多项式除法，写成「多项式 + 真分式」。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 分母因式分解到底：只剩一次因子和不能再分解的二次因子。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 按上表写部分分式，系数待定。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 两边乘分母，得到对所有 $x$ 都成立的等式：先代「让某个因子为 0」的 $x$，一次求出一个系数；剩下的比较 $x^3$、常数项这些系数。求完代一个别的 $x$ 验一下。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 逐项积分：一次因子 → $\\ln$；重复因子的高次项 → 幂函数；二次因子 → $\\ln$ 加 $\\arctan$。"}]},{"t":"box","kind":"why","label":"直觉","title":"","body":[{"t":"p","text":"为什么重复因子要从 1 次设到最高次：$\\dfrac A{x-1}+\\dfrac B{(x-1)^2}=\\dfrac{A(x-1)+B}{(x-1)^2}$，分子可以是任何一次式。只设 $\\dfrac B{(x-1)^2}$，分子只能是常数，凑不出 $3x+6$ 这样的分子。"},{"t":"p","text":"为什么二次因子的分子要设一次式 $Bx+C$：同样道理，分子要有两个可调的数，才能凑出任意的一次式。"}]},{"t":"ex","title":"不同的一次因子","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int\\dfrac{x+5}{(x-1)(x+2)}\\,dx$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"设 $\\dfrac{x+5}{(x-1)(x+2)}=\\dfrac A{x-1}+\\dfrac B{x+2}$，两边乘分母：$x+5=A(x+2)+B(x-1)$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"代 $x=1$：$6=3A$，$A=2$。代 $x=-2$：$3=-3B$，$B=-1$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"原式 $=\\int\\left(\\dfrac2{x-1}-\\dfrac1{x+2}\\right)dx=2\\ln|x-1|-\\ln|x+2|+C$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"重复因子","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int\\dfrac{dx}{x^2(x+1)}$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"$x^2$ 是重复因子：设 $\\dfrac1{x^2(x+1)}=\\dfrac Ax+\\dfrac B{x^2}+\\dfrac C{x+1}$，两边乘分母：$1=Ax(x+1)+B(x+1)+Cx^2$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"代 $x=0$：$B=1$。代 $x=-1$：$C=1$。比较 $x^2$ 的系数：$A+C=0$，$A=-1$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"原式 $=\\int\\left(-\\dfrac1x+\\dfrac1{x^2}+\\dfrac1{x+1}\\right)dx=-\\ln|x|-\\dfrac1x+\\ln|x+1|+C$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"假分式先除","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int\\dfrac{x^3}{x^2-1}\\,dx$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"分子 3 次、分母 2 次，先除：$x^3=x(x^2-1)+x$，所以 $\\dfrac{x^3}{x^2-1}=x+\\dfrac{x}{x^2-1}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$\\dfrac{x}{x^2-1}$ 的分子是分母导数的一半，直接凑微分：$\\int\\dfrac{x}{x^2-1}dx=\\dfrac12\\ln|x^2-1|$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"原式 $=\\dfrac{x^2}2+\\dfrac12\\ln|x^2-1|+C$。"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["重复因子 $(x-1)^2$ 只设了 $\\dfrac B{(x-1)^2}$，漏了 $\\dfrac A{x-1}$。","二次因子 $x^2+x+1$ 的分子只设了常数 $C$。","分子次数不低于分母，没先做除法就直接拆。","$\\int\\dfrac{B}{(x-a)^2}dx$ 积成 $B\\ln(x-a)^2$。应该是 $-\\dfrac{B}{x-a}$。","一个系数算错，后面全错：求完代一个别的 $x$ 验一下。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"4-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int\\dfrac{dx}{x^2-3x+2}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\ln\\left|\\frac{x-2}{x-1}\\right|+C$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$x^2-3x+2=(x-1)(x-2)$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 设 $\\dfrac1{(x-1)(x-2)}=\\dfrac A{x-1}+\\dfrac B{x-2}$，两边乘分母：$1=A(x-2)+B(x-1)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 代 $x=1$：$1=-A$，$A=-1$。代 $x=2$：$B=1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 原式 $=\\int\\left(\\dfrac1{x-2}-\\dfrac1{x-1}\\right)dx=\\ln|x-2|-\\ln|x-1|+C=\\ln\\left|\\dfrac{x-2}{x-1}\\right|+C$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"分母能分解成两个不同的一次因子 → 各设一项，代零点求系数。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"4-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int\\dfrac{x+2}{x(x+1)^2}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$2\\ln|x|-2\\ln|x+1|+\\frac{1}{x+1}+C$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"设 $\\dfrac Ax+\\dfrac B{x+1}+\\dfrac C{(x+1)^2}$；代 $x=0$、$x=-1$ 各求出一个。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$A=2$，$C=-1$；再比较 $x^2$ 的系数求 $B$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 两边乘分母：$x+2=A(x+1)^2+Bx(x+1)+Cx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 代 $x=0$：$2=A$。代 $x=-1$：$1=-C$，$C=-1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 比较 $x^2$ 的系数：$0=A+B$，$B=-2$。验算：代 $x=1$，左边 3，右边 $2\\cdot4-2\\cdot2-1=3$，对。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=\\int\\left(\\dfrac2x-\\dfrac2{x+1}-\\dfrac1{(x+1)^2}\\right)dx=2\\ln|x|-2\\ln|x+1|+\\dfrac1{x+1}+C$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"分母有重复因子 $(x+1)^2$ → 从 1 次设到 2 次；先代零点，剩下一个比系数。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"4-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int\\dfrac{2x^2+x+1}{(x+1)(x^2+1)}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\ln|x+1|+\\frac12\\ln(x^2+1)+C$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"设 $\\dfrac A{x+1}+\\dfrac{Bx+C}{x^2+1}$，代 $x=-1$ 得 $A$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$A=1$；把 $\\dfrac1{x+1}$ 那部分移过去，剩下 $x^2+x=(Bx+C)(x+1)$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 两边乘分母：$2x^2+x+1=A(x^2+1)+(Bx+C)(x+1)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 代 $x=-1$：$2-1+1=2A$，$A=1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 移项：$(Bx+C)(x+1)=2x^2+x+1-(x^2+1)=x^2+x=x(x+1)$，所以 $Bx+C=x$，$B=1$，$C=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=\\int\\left(\\dfrac1{x+1}+\\dfrac{x}{x^2+1}\\right)dx=\\ln|x+1|+\\dfrac12\\ln(x^2+1)+C$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"分母有一个一次因子和一个不能分解的二次因子 → 一次因子设 $\\frac A{x+1}$，二次因子分子设 $Bx+C$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"4-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int\\dfrac{x^4}{x^2+1}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac{x^3}3-x+\\arctan x+C$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"假分式，先除：$x^4=(x^2-1)(x^2+1)+1$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $x^4=(x^2-1)(x^2+1)+1$，所以 $\\dfrac{x^4}{x^2+1}=x^2-1+\\dfrac1{x^2+1}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 逐项积分：$\\dfrac{x^3}3-x+\\arctan x+C$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"分子次数比分母高 → 先做多项式除法，剩下的真分式再积。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"4-p5","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int\\dfrac{x^2+3}{(x+1)^2(x^2+1)}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\ln|x+1|-\\frac2{x+1}-\\frac12\\ln(x^2+1)+C$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"设 $\\dfrac A{x+1}+\\dfrac B{(x+1)^2}+\\dfrac{Cx+D}{x^2+1}$；代 $x=-1$ 得 $B=2$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"比较 $x^3$ 系数：$A+C=0$；常数项：$A+B+D=3$；再比较 $x^2$ 系数。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 两边乘分母：$x^2+3=A(x+1)(x^2+1)+B(x^2+1)+(Cx+D)(x+1)^2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 代 $x=-1$：$4=2B$，$B=2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 展开比系数。$x^3$：$A+C=0$。$x^2$：$A+B+2C+D=1$。常数项：$A+B+D=3$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 常数项减 $x^2$ 那一式：$-2C=2$，$C=-1$，于是 $A=1$；由常数项 $1+2+D=3$，$D=0$。验算 $x$ 的系数：$A+C+2D=0$，左边 $x$ 的系数也是 0，对。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 原式 $=\\int\\left(\\dfrac1{x+1}+\\dfrac2{(x+1)^2}-\\dfrac{x}{x^2+1}\\right)dx=\\ln|x+1|-\\dfrac2{x+1}-\\dfrac12\\ln(x^2+1)+C$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"分母有重复因子 $(x+1)^2$ 和二次因子 $x^2+1$ → 重复因子设两项，二次因子分子设一次式；先代零点，再比系数。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2019-16","src":{"year":2019,"no":16,"score":10,"type":"解答"},"type":"解答","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求不定积分 $\\int \\dfrac{3x + 6}{(x - 1)^2(x^2 + x + 1)}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$-2\\ln|x-1|-\\frac3{x-1}+\\ln(x^2+x+1)+C$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"设 $\\dfrac A{x-1}+\\dfrac B{(x-1)^2}+\\dfrac{Cx+D}{x^2+x+1}$；代 $x=1$ 得 $B$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$B=3$；再比较 $x^3$、$x^2$、$x$ 的系数，解出 $A=-2$ 以及 $C$、$D$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 设 $\\dfrac{3x+6}{(x-1)^2(x^2+x+1)}=\\dfrac A{x-1}+\\dfrac B{(x-1)^2}+\\dfrac{Cx+D}{x^2+x+1}$。$x^2+x+1$ 的判别式 $1-4<0$，不能再分解。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 两边乘分母：$3x+6=A(x-1)(x^2+x+1)+B(x^2+x+1)+(Cx+D)(x-1)^2$。其中 $(x-1)(x^2+x+1)=x^3-1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 代 $x=1$：$9=3B$，$B=3$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 比较系数。$x^3$：$A+C=0$。$x^2$：$B-2C+D=0$。$x$：$B+C-2D=3$。把 $B=3$ 代入：$C=2D$，$3-4D+D=0$，所以 $D=1$，$C=2$，$A=-2$。验算常数项：$-A+B+D=2+3+1=6$，对。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 原式 $=\\int\\left(\\dfrac{-2}{x-1}+\\dfrac3{(x-1)^2}+\\dfrac{2x+1}{x^2+x+1}\\right)dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑥ 逐项积分：$-2\\ln|x-1|$；$-\\dfrac3{x-1}$；$\\dfrac{2x+1}{x^2+x+1}$ 的分子正好是分母的导数，积出 $\\ln(x^2+x+1)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑦ 原式 $=-2\\ln|x-1|-\\dfrac3{x-1}+\\ln(x^2+x+1)+C$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"分母有重复因子 $(x-1)^2$ 和不能分解的二次因子 $x^2+x+1$ → 重复因子设两项、二次因子分子设一次式，四个待定系数；先代 $x=1$，再比系数。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"二次因子那项分子恰好是分母导数，是出题人设计好的；如果不是，就按 [[节1]] 拆成「分母导数 + 常数」。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"later","text":"2020 年以后本节考过：2025-17（裂项后算定积分，$\\ln$ 和 $\\arctan$ 都有）。"},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"有理分式 → 假分式先除 → 分母分解到底 → 一次因子设一项、重复因子从 1 次设到最高次、二次因子分子设 $Bx+C$ → 先代零点、再比系数、最后代一个值验算 → 一次项积出 $\\ln$，平方项积出 $-\\frac{B}{x-a}$，二次因子拆成「分母导数 + 常数」。"}]}]},{"id":"5","label":"节5","title":"分段函数的原函数","minutes":25,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：选择题「下列哪个是分段函数 $f(x)$ 的原函数」。2010–2019 年 1 道（2016-2）；2023 年又考了一道。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"5-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $f(x)=|x|$ 的一个原函数。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$F(x)=\\frac{x|x|}2$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$x\\ge0$ 时积 $x$ 得 $\\frac{x^2}2+C_1$；$x<0$ 时积 $-x$ 得 $-\\frac{x^2}2+C_2$。原函数在 0 处要连续：$C_1=C_2$，都取 0。合起来就是 $\\frac{x|x|}2$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"5-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$F(x)=\\begin{cases}x^2,&x<0,\\\\x^2+1,&x\\ge0\\end{cases}$ 是 $f(x)=2x$ 在 $(-\\infty,+\\infty)$ 上的原函数吗？"}],"options":{},"answer":"不是","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"两段各自求导都是 $2x$，但 $F$ 在 0 处左极限 0、函数值 1，不连续，所以在 0 处不可导，$F'(0)=f(0)$ 不成立。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"原函数一定连续"},{"t":"p","text":"$F$ 是 $f$ 在区间上的原函数，意思是区间上每一点都有 $F'(x)=f(x)$。可导一定连续，所以**原函数在整个区间上连续**，分段点也不例外。"},{"t":"p","text":"分段积分时每段各有一个常数。只有选对常数，让 $F$ 在分段点接上，拼出来的才是原函数。"},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"分段函数求原函数","body":[{"t":"p","text":"① 每段分别积分，各带一个常数：$F_1(x)+C_1$、$F_2(x)+C_2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 在分段点 $x_0$ 处要连续：左段在 $x_0$ 的极限 = 右段在 $x_0$ 的值，解出 $C_1$ 和 $C_2$ 的关系。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 让某一段的常数取 0（或用题给的条件定），写出 $F$；求「全部原函数」就在最后统一加 $C$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 选择题：在分段点处检查每个选项左右两段的值是否相等，再检查每段求导对不对。"}]},{"t":"box","kind":"why","label":"直觉","title":"","body":[{"t":"p","text":"原函数可以看成「从某点开始累积的面积」$\\int_a^xf(t)\\,dt$ 加一个常数。面积随 $x$ 连续变化，不会突然跳一下，所以原函数一定连续。"},{"t":"p","text":"本节的题，$f$ 本身在分段点是连续的，只是分段写；$f$ 有跳跃间断点时根本没有原函数（第8讲）。"}]},{"t":"ex","title":"接常数","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x)=\\begin{cases}e^x,&x<0,\\\\1+x,&x\\ge0,\\end{cases}$ 求 $f$ 的全部原函数。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"左段：$\\int e^xdx=e^x+C_1$。右段：$\\int(1+x)\\,dx=x+\\dfrac{x^2}2+C_2$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"在 0 处连续：左段 $x\\to0^-$ 时 $\\to1+C_1$，右段在 0 处 $=C_2$。所以 $C_2=1+C_1$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"记 $C_1=C$：$F(x)=\\begin{cases}e^x+C,&x<0,\\\\x+\\frac{x^2}2+1+C,&x\\ge0.\\end{cases}$"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["两段各自积分后常数都写成 0，拼起来在分段点不连续。","只核对「每段求导等于 $f$」，忘了检查分段点。","把「$f$ 在分段点连续」和「$F$ 在分段点连续」混为一谈：前者是题目给的 $f$ 的性质，后者是原函数必须满足的条件。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"5-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x)=\\begin{cases}x,&x<0,\\\\\\sin x,&x\\ge0,\\end{cases}$ 求 $f$ 的满足 $F(0)=0$ 的原函数 $F(x)$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$F(x)=\\begin{cases}\\frac{x^2}2,&x<0,\\\\1-\\cos x,&x\\ge0\\end{cases}$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"右段 $\\int\\sin x\\,dx=-\\cos x+C_2$，用 $F(0)=0$ 定 $C_2$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 左段：$\\int x\\,dx=\\dfrac{x^2}2+C_1$；右段：$\\int\\sin x\\,dx=-\\cos x+C_2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $F(0)=0$：右段在 0 处 $-1+C_2=0$，$C_2=1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 在 0 处连续：左段 $x\\to0^-$ 时 $\\to C_1$，所以 $C_1=F(0)=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $F(x)=\\dfrac{x^2}2$（$x<0$），$F(x)=1-\\cos x$（$x\\ge0$）。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"分段函数求原函数 → 每段积分各带常数；$F(0)=0$ 定右段，连续定左段。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"5-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $f(x)=\\max\\{1,x^2\\}$ 在 $(-\\infty,+\\infty)$ 上满足 $F(0)=0$ 的原函数。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$F(x)=\\begin{cases}\\frac{x^3}3-\\frac23,&x<-1,\\\\x,&|x|\\le1,\\\\\\frac{x^3}3+\\frac23,&x>1\\end{cases}$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"先写成分段：$|x|\\le1$ 时 $f=1$，$|x|>1$ 时 $f=x^2$。两个分段点 $x=\\pm1$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"中间段 $F=x$；右段 $\\frac{x^3}3+C_2$ 在 $x=1$ 处要等于 1。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $|x|\\le1$ 时 $x^2\\le1$，$f=1$；$|x|>1$ 时 $f=x^2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 中间段：$F=x+C_0$，$F(0)=0$ 得 $C_0=0$，$F=x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 右段：$F=\\dfrac{x^3}3+C_2$，在 $x=1$ 处接上中间段的值 1：$\\dfrac13+C_2=1$，$C_2=\\dfrac23$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 左段：$F=\\dfrac{x^3}3+C_1$，在 $x=-1$ 处接上 $-1$：$-\\dfrac13+C_1=-1$，$C_1=-\\dfrac23$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\max$ 先写成分段函数；三段、两个分段点 → 从含 0 的中间段开始，用连续性往两边接。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"5-p3","src":null,"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"已知函数 $f(x)=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{1}{1+x^2},&x<0,\\\\xe^x+1,&x\\ge0,\\end{cases}$ 则 $f(x)$ 的一个原函数是（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$F(x)=\\begin{cases}\\arctan x,&x<0\\\\(x-1)e^x+x,&x\\ge0\\end{cases}$","B":"$F(x)=\\begin{cases}\\arctan x,&x<0\\\\(x-1)e^x+x+1,&x\\ge0\\end{cases}$","C":"$F(x)=\\begin{cases}\\arctan x+1,&x<0\\\\(x-1)e^x+x,&x\\ge0\\end{cases}$","D":"$F(x)=\\begin{cases}\\arctan x,&x<0\\\\(x+1)e^x+x-1,&x\\ge0\\end{cases}$"},"answer":"B","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"右段 $\\int xe^xdx=(x-1)e^x$；先排除求导不对的选项。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"剩下的选项在 $x=0$ 处比较左右两段的值。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 每段求导：$(\\arctan x)'=\\dfrac1{1+x^2}$；$\\left[(x-1)e^x+x\\right]'=e^x+(x-1)e^x+1=xe^x+1$，对。D 的右段 $\\left[(x+1)e^x\\right]'=(x+2)e^x$，不对，排除 D。"},{"t":"p","text":"② A：左段在 0 处趋于 $\\arctan0=0$，右段 $F(0)=-1$，不连续。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ B：右段 $F(0)=-1+0+1=0$，和左段的 0 接上了。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ C：左段趋于 1，右段 $-1$，不连续。选 B。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"分段函数的原函数 → 两件事都要查：每段求导等于 $f$，分段点处左右接上。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2016-02","src":{"year":2016,"no":2,"score":4,"type":"选择"},"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"已知函数 $f(x)=\\begin{cases}2(x-1),&x<1,\\\\\\ln x,&x\\ge 1,\\end{cases}$ 则 $f(x)$ 的一个原函数是（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$F(x)=\\begin{cases}(x-1)^2,&x<1,\\\\x(\\ln x-1),&x\\ge 1.\\end{cases}$","B":"$F(x)=\\begin{cases}(x-1)^2,&x<1,\\\\x(\\ln x+1)-1,&x\\ge 1.\\end{cases}$","C":"$F(x)=\\begin{cases}(x-1)^2,&x<1,\\\\x(\\ln x+1)+1,&x\\ge 1.\\end{cases}$","D":"$F(x)=\\begin{cases}(x-1)^2,&x<1,\\\\x(\\ln x-1)+1,&x\\ge 1.\\end{cases}$"},"answer":"D","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-x+C$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"左段在 $x=1$ 处的值是 0，看哪个右段在 $x=1$ 处也是 0。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $x<1$：$\\int2(x-1)\\,dx=(x-1)^2+C_1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $x\\ge1$：$\\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-x+C_2=x(\\ln x-1)+C_2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 在 $x=1$ 处连续：左段趋于 $0+C_1$，右段 $1\\cdot(0-1)+C_2=C_2-1$。所以 $C_2=C_1+1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 取 $C_1=0$，$C_2=1$：右段是 $x(\\ln x-1)+1$，选 D。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 核对其他选项：A 右段在 1 处是 $-1$，接不上；B、C 右段求导是 $\\ln x+2$，不对。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"分段函数求原函数 → 分别积分，再用「原函数在分段点连续」定常数。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"later","text":"2020 年以后本节考过：2023-2（左段 $\\frac1{\\sqrt{1+x^2}}$ 积出 $\\ln(x+\\sqrt{1+x^2})$，在 0 处接常数）。"},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"分段函数求原函数 → 每段分别积分、各带一个常数 → 用「原函数一定连续」在分段点把常数接上 → 选择题：先查每段求导，再代分段点看左右是否相等。"}]}]},{"id":"6","label":"节6","title":"反常积分的计算","minutes":35,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：填空「求一个反常积分的值」，往往要先配方、裂项或分部。2010–2019 年 3 道：2014-9、2017-11、2018-11；2025 年又考了一道含参数的。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"6-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^{+\\infty}e^{-2x}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac12$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_0^{+\\infty}e^{-2x}dx=-\\dfrac12e^{-2x}\\Big|_0^{+\\infty}=0-\\left(-\\dfrac12\\right)=\\dfrac12$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"6-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{x}{(1+x^2)^2}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac12$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"凑微分 $x\\,dx=\\frac12d(1+x^2)$：原函数 $-\\dfrac1{2(1+x^2)}$。$x\\to+\\infty$ 时趋于 0，$x=0$ 时为 $-\\frac12$，积分 $=0-\\left(-\\frac12\\right)=\\frac12$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"反常积分 = 原函数 + 取极限"},{"t":"p","text":"反常积分没有新的积分方法：先用前五节的方法求原函数，再在坏点处取极限（第8讲讲过怎么找坏点、怎么判断收敛）。"},{"t":"p","text":"写成 $F(x)\\Big|_a^{+\\infty}$ 时，$F(+\\infty)$ 的意思是 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}F(x)$，不是把 $\\infty$ 代进去。"},{"t":"p","text":"常用的极限值："},{"t":"ul","items":["$x\\to+\\infty$：$\\arctan x\\to\\frac\\pi2$；$x\\to-\\infty$：$\\arctan x\\to-\\frac\\pi2$。","$x\\to+\\infty$：$x^ne^{-x}\\to0$，$\\dfrac{\\ln x}{x}\\to0$；$x\\to0^+$：$x\\ln x\\to0$。"]},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"反常积分的计算","body":[{"t":"p","text":"① 找坏点：无穷端点；让被积函数无界的点。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 在有限区间上求原函数 $F$：凑微分、换元、分部、裂项。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 在坏点取极限：$\\int_a^{+\\infty}f(x)\\,dx=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}F(x)-F(a)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原函数是几个 $\\ln$ 的和差，先合并成**一个**对数再取极限：$\\ln(x-3)-\\ln(x-1)=\\ln\\dfrac{x-3}{x-1}\\to\\ln1=0$。"}]},{"t":"box","kind":"why","label":"直觉","title":"","body":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\ln(x-3)$ 和 $\\ln(x-1)$ 都趋于 $+\\infty$，单独看是「$\\infty-\\infty$」，看不出是多少；合成 $\\ln\\dfrac{x-3}{x-1}$ 就清楚了：两个数越来越接近，比值趋于 1，对数趋于 0。"}]},{"t":"ex","title":"裂项 + 无穷限","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_2^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{x^2-1}$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"裂项：$\\dfrac1{x^2-1}=\\dfrac12\\left(\\dfrac1{x-1}-\\dfrac1{x+1}\\right)$，原函数合成一个对数：$\\dfrac12\\ln\\dfrac{x-1}{x+1}$（$x\\ge2$ 时里面是正的）。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$x\\to+\\infty$ 时 $\\dfrac{x-1}{x+1}\\to1$，原函数 $\\to0$；$x=2$ 时为 $\\dfrac12\\ln\\dfrac13$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"原式 $=0-\\dfrac12\\ln\\dfrac13=\\dfrac12\\ln3$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"配方 + 两端无穷","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{x^2+2x+2}$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"配方：$x^2+2x+2=(x+1)^2+1$，原函数 $\\arctan(x+1)$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$x\\to+\\infty$ 时 $\\to\\dfrac\\pi2$；$x\\to-\\infty$ 时 $\\to-\\dfrac\\pi2$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"原式 $=\\dfrac\\pi2-\\left(-\\dfrac\\pi2\\right)=\\pi$。"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["直接把 $+\\infty$ 代进原函数，写出 $\\ln\\infty-\\ln\\infty=0$ 之类的式子。","两个发散的 $\\ln$ 分开取极限：$\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\frac{dx}{x}-\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\frac{dx}{x+1}$ 两个都发散，不能这样拆。","$\\arctan(-\\infty)$ 写成 0 或 $\\frac\\pi2$。应是 $-\\frac\\pi2$。","配方后 $\\frac12\\arctan\\frac{x+1}2$ 前面的 $\\frac12$ 丢了。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"6-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{x^2+4}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac\\pi4$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"原函数 $\\frac12\\arctan\\frac x2$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 原函数：$\\dfrac12\\arctan\\dfrac x2$（$a=2$）。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $x\\to+\\infty$ 时 $\\to\\dfrac12\\cdot\\dfrac\\pi2=\\dfrac\\pi4$；$x=0$ 时为 0。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 原式 $=\\dfrac\\pi4$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"无穷限、分母是 $x^2+a^2$ → 原函数 $\\frac1a\\arctan\\frac xa$，在 $+\\infty$ 取极限。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"6-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{x^2(1+x)}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$1-\\ln2$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$\\dfrac1{x^2(1+x)}=-\\dfrac1x+\\dfrac1{x^2}+\\dfrac1{1+x}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"两个 $\\ln$ 合成 $\\ln\\dfrac{1+x}{x}$ 再取极限。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 设 $\\dfrac1{x^2(1+x)}=\\dfrac Ax+\\dfrac B{x^2}+\\dfrac C{1+x}$，$1=Ax(1+x)+B(1+x)+Cx^2$。代 $x=0$：$B=1$；代 $x=-1$：$C=1$；$x^2$ 系数 $A+C=0$，$A=-1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 原函数：$-\\ln x-\\dfrac1x+\\ln(1+x)=\\ln\\dfrac{1+x}{x}-\\dfrac1x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $x\\to+\\infty$：$\\dfrac{1+x}x\\to1$，$\\dfrac1x\\to0$，原函数 $\\to0$。$x=1$：$\\ln2-1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=0-(\\ln2-1)=1-\\ln2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"有理函数、分母有重复因子 $x^2$ → 先裂项求原函数；无穷限，$\\ln$ 合并后取极限。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"6-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{\\arctan x}{x^2}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac\\pi4+\\frac12\\ln2$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"分部：$u=\\arctan x$，$dv=\\dfrac{dx}{x^2}$，$v=-\\dfrac1x$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"剩下 $\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{x(1+x^2)}$，$\\dfrac1{x(1+x^2)}=\\dfrac1x-\\dfrac{x}{1+x^2}$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 分部：$\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{\\arctan x}{x^2}dx=-\\dfrac{\\arctan x}{x}\\Big|_1^{+\\infty}+\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{x(1+x^2)}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 边界项：$x\\to+\\infty$ 时 $\\dfrac{\\arctan x}x\\to0$；$x=1$ 时为 $\\dfrac\\pi4$。边界项 $=0-\\left(-\\dfrac\\pi4\\right)=\\dfrac\\pi4$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 裂项：$\\dfrac1{x(1+x^2)}=\\dfrac1x-\\dfrac x{1+x^2}$，原函数 $\\ln x-\\dfrac12\\ln(1+x^2)=\\ln\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{1+x^2}}$。$x\\to+\\infty$ 时 $\\to\\ln1=0$；$x=1$ 时为 $\\ln\\dfrac1{\\sqrt2}=-\\dfrac12\\ln2$。这部分 $=\\dfrac12\\ln2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=\\dfrac\\pi4+\\dfrac12\\ln2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"反三角乘幂函数 → 分部，反三角当 $u$；剩下的有理函数裂项，$\\ln$ 合并后取极限。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"6-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^{1}\\dfrac{dx}{\\sqrt{x(1-x)}}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\pi$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"两端 $x=0$、$x=1$ 都是瑕点；配方 $x(1-x)=\\frac14-\\left(x-\\frac12\\right)^2$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"原函数 $\\arcsin(2x-1)$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 配方：$x(1-x)=\\dfrac14-\\left(x-\\dfrac12\\right)^2$，$a=\\dfrac12$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $\\int\\dfrac{dx}{\\sqrt{a^2-u^2}}=\\arcsin\\dfrac ua$：原函数 $\\arcsin\\dfrac{x-\\frac12}{\\frac12}=\\arcsin(2x-1)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $x\\to1^-$ 时 $\\to\\arcsin1=\\dfrac\\pi2$；$x\\to0^+$ 时 $\\to\\arcsin(-1)=-\\dfrac\\pi2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=\\dfrac\\pi2-\\left(-\\dfrac\\pi2\\right)=\\pi$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"两个端点处分母为 0，是瑕点；根号里是二次式 → 配方成 $a^2-u^2$，原函数是 $\\arcsin$，再在两端取极限。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"6-p5","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{xe^{x}}{(1+e^{x})^2}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\ln2$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$\\dfrac{e^x}{(1+e^x)^2}\\,dx=d\\left(-\\dfrac1{1+e^x}\\right)$，所以分部时 $u=x$，$v=-\\dfrac1{1+e^x}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"剩下 $\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{1+e^x}$，分子分母同乘 $e^{-x}$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $\\left(-\\dfrac1{1+e^x}\\right)'=\\dfrac{e^x}{(1+e^x)^2}$，取 $u=x$，$v=-\\dfrac1{1+e^x}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 原式 $=-\\dfrac{x}{1+e^x}\\Big|_0^{+\\infty}+\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{1+e^x}$。边界项：$x\\to+\\infty$ 时 $\\dfrac x{1+e^x}\\to0$，$x=0$ 时为 0，边界项 $=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $\\dfrac1{1+e^x}=\\dfrac{e^{-x}}{e^{-x}+1}$，原函数 $-\\ln(1+e^{-x})$。$x\\to+\\infty$ 时 $\\to0$，$x=0$ 时为 $-\\ln2$。这部分 $=\\ln2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=\\ln2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"多项式 $x$ 乘一个能凑出原函数的部分 → 分部，$x$ 当 $u$；剩下的积分凑微分。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"若取 $v=\\dfrac{e^x}{1+e^x}$（另一个原函数），边界项和剩下的积分在 $+\\infty$ 都发散，只能合在一起取极限。$v$ 选得好，两部分各自收敛，算起来干净。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2014-09","src":{"year":2014,"no":9,"score":4,"type":"填空"},"type":"填空","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_{-\\infty}^{1} \\dfrac{1}{x^2 + 2x + 5}\\,dx =$____。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\dfrac{3\\pi}8$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"配方：$x^2+2x+5=(x+1)^2+4$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"原函数 $\\frac12\\arctan\\frac{x+1}2$；$x\\to-\\infty$ 时 $\\arctan$ 趋于 $-\\frac\\pi2$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 判别式 $4-20<0$，配方：$x^2+2x+5=(x+1)^2+2^2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 原函数：$\\dfrac12\\arctan\\dfrac{x+1}2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $x=1$：$\\dfrac12\\arctan1=\\dfrac12\\cdot\\dfrac\\pi4=\\dfrac\\pi8$。$x\\to-\\infty$：$\\dfrac12\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac\\pi2\\right)=-\\dfrac\\pi4$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=\\dfrac\\pi8-\\left(-\\dfrac\\pi4\\right)=\\dfrac{3\\pi}8$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"无穷限、分母是不能分解的二次式 → 配方，原函数是 $\\frac1a\\arctan\\frac{x+m}a$，下限取极限。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2017-11","src":{"year":2017,"no":11,"score":4,"type":"填空"},"type":"填空","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{\\ln(1+x)}{(1+x)^2}\\,dx=$____。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$1$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"令 $t=1+x$，变成 $\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{\\ln t}{t^2}dt$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"分部：$u=\\ln t$，$dv=\\dfrac{dt}{t^2}$，$v=-\\dfrac1t$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 令 $t=1+x$，$x$ 从 0 到 $+\\infty$ 时 $t$ 从 1 到 $+\\infty$：原式 $=\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{\\ln t}{t^2}dt$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 分部：$u=\\ln t$，$v=-\\dfrac1t$：$\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{\\ln t}{t^2}dt=-\\dfrac{\\ln t}{t}\\Big|_1^{+\\infty}+\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dt}{t^2}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 边界项：$t\\to+\\infty$ 时 $\\dfrac{\\ln t}t\\to0$；$t=1$ 时 $\\ln1=0$。边界项为 0。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dt}{t^2}=-\\dfrac1t\\Big|_1^{+\\infty}=0-(-1)=1$。原式 $=1$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"对数乘幂函数 → 分部，对数当 $u$；先令 $t=1+x$ 让式子干净一些。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2018-11","src":{"year":2018,"no":11,"score":4,"type":"填空"},"type":"填空","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_5^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{x^2-4x+3}\\,dx=$____。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\dfrac12\\ln2$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$x^2-4x+3=(x-1)(x-3)$，裂项。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"原函数 $\\frac12\\ln\\frac{x-3}{x-1}$，先合成一个对数再取极限。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $\\dfrac1{(x-1)(x-3)}=\\dfrac12\\left(\\dfrac1{x-3}-\\dfrac1{x-1}\\right)$（代 $x=3$、$x=1$ 求出两个系数 $\\frac12$、$-\\frac12$）。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 原函数：$\\dfrac12\\ln|x-3|-\\dfrac12\\ln|x-1|=\\dfrac12\\ln\\dfrac{x-3}{x-1}$（$x\\ge5$ 时都是正的）。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $x\\to+\\infty$：$\\dfrac{x-3}{x-1}\\to1$，原函数 $\\to0$。$x=5$：$\\dfrac12\\ln\\dfrac24=-\\dfrac12\\ln2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=0-\\left(-\\dfrac12\\ln2\\right)=\\dfrac12\\ln2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"分母能分解 → 裂项求原函数；两个 $\\ln$ 合并成一个，再在 $+\\infty$ 取极限。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"later","text":"2020 年以后本节考过：2025-11（含参数 $a$：裂项算出积分，令它等于 $\\ln2$ 解出 $a$）。"},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"反常积分 → 先找坏点 → 用前几节的方法求原函数 → 在坏点取极限：$\\arctan\\to\\pm\\frac\\pi2$，$x^ne^{-x}\\to0$，$\\frac{\\ln x}x\\to0$ → 几个 $\\ln$ 先合成一个再取极限，不能拆成「$\\infty-\\infty$」。"}]}]},{"id":"7","label":"节7","title":"综合：积分里套着积分、周期与奇偶","minutes":35,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：题目不告诉方法。被积函数本身是算不出来的变限积分，用分部把它求导掉；或者给出 $f'$ 和周期、奇偶，求远处的函数值。填空 4–5 分。2010–2019 年 2 道：2014-10、2019-13；2021 年又考了一道（要先交换积分次序，第14讲）。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"7-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x)=\\int_x^1e^{-t^2}dt$，求 $f(1)$ 和 $f'(x)$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$f(1)=0$，$f'(x)=-e^{-x^2}$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"上下限相同，积分为 0，$f(1)=0$。下限是 $x$：$f(x)=-\\int_1^xe^{-t^2}dt$，求导 $f'(x)=-e^{-x^2}$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"7-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x)$ 是周期为 2 的奇函数，在 $x=1$ 处有定义。求 $f(1)$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$0$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"周期 2：$f(1)=f(1-2)=f(-1)$；奇函数：$f(-1)=-f(1)$。所以 $f(1)=-f(1)$，$f(1)=0$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"积分里套着积分：分部，让它被求导"},{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_a^bf(x)\\,dx$ 里的 $f(x)=\\int_c^xg(t)\\,dt$ 写不出来（$\\int e^{-t^2}dt$、$\\int\\frac{\\sin t}{t}dt$ 都没有初等原函数）：分部积分，让 $f$ 当 $u$，$f'=g$ 一求导积分号就没了。"},{"t":"p","text":"$v$ 怎么选：让边界项消掉。$f$ 在哪个端点为 0（上下限相同），$v$ 就在另一个端点为 0。例如 $f(b)=0$ 时取 $v=x-a$：$\\int_a^bf(x)\\,dx=(x-a)f(x)\\Big|_a^b-\\int_a^b(x-a)f'(x)\\,dx=-\\int_a^b(x-a)g(x)\\,dx$。"},{"t":"h","text":"周期与奇偶定函数值"},{"t":"ul","items":["奇函数在 0 有定义时 $f(0)=0$。","周期 $T$：$f(x+T)=f(x)$，远处的点挪回一个周期里。","奇函数又以 $T$ 为周期：$f\\left(\\frac T2\\right)=f\\left(-\\frac T2\\right)=-f\\left(\\frac T2\\right)$，所以 $f\\left(\\frac T2\\right)=0$。"]},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"积分里套着积分","body":[{"t":"p","text":"① 认出：被积函数里有变限积分 $f(x)=\\int_c^xg(t)\\,dt$，而 $g$ 积不出来。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 分部：$u=f(x)$，$du=g(x)\\,dx$；$dv=dx$（或 $x\\,dx$ 等，题目给什么就是什么）。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 选 $v$ 让边界项为 0：$f$ 在一个端点为 0，$v$ 在另一个端点为 0。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 剩下的 $\\int v\\,g(x)\\,dx$ 一般能凑微分积出来。"}]},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"周期、奇偶定函数值","body":[{"t":"p","text":"① 由一段上的 $f'$ 积分，得到这段上的 $f$，带常数 $C$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 用奇函数的 $f(0)=0$（或题给的值）定出 $C$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 要求的点用周期挪进已知区间附近；挪到负半轴，就用奇偶翻到正半轴。"}]},{"t":"box","kind":"why","label":"直觉","title":"","body":[{"t":"p","text":"为什么分部能「去掉」积分号：$f(x)=\\int_1^xg(t)\\,dt$ 求导就是 $g(x)$；分部积分把求导转移到 $f$ 身上，积分号自然没了。"}]},{"t":"ex","title":"积分里套积分","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $f(x)=\\int_x^1e^{-t^2}dt$，求 $\\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"$f(1)=0$，$f'(x)=-e^{-x^2}$。$f(1)=0$，所以取 $v=x$（在 0 处为 0）。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"分部：$\\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx=xf(x)\\Big|_0^1-\\int_0^1xf'(x)\\,dx=0+\\int_0^1xe^{-x^2}dx$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"凑微分：$\\int_0^1xe^{-x^2}dx=-\\dfrac12e^{-x^2}\\Big|_0^1=\\dfrac12\\left(1-e^{-1}\\right)$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"周期 + 奇偶","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x)$ 是周期为 4 的可导奇函数，$x\\in[0,2]$ 时 $f'(x)=3x^2-4$。求 $f(9)$ 和 $f(-5)$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"$[0,2]$ 上积分：$f(x)=x^3-4x+C$；奇函数 $f(0)=0$，$C=0$，$f(x)=x^3-4x$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$f(9)=f(9-8)=f(1)=1-4=-3$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$f(-5)=f(-5+4)=f(-1)=-f(1)=3$。"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["分部后边界项没算，默认为 0。先看 $f$ 在哪个端点为 0，再决定 $v$。","变限积分求导，下限是 $x$ 时漏了负号：$\\left(\\int_x^1g(t)\\,dt\\right)'=-g(x)$。","周期挪点没挪进已知区间：$f(7)=f(3)$ 还不够，3 不在 $[0,2]$ 里，要继续挪成 $f(-1)$ 再用奇偶。","由 $f'$ 积分得 $f$ 后，忘了用 $f(0)=0$ 定 $C$。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"7-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $f(x)=\\int_1^{x}\\dfrac{\\sin t}{t}\\,dt$，求 $\\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\cos1-1$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$f(1)=0$，$f'(x)=\\dfrac{\\sin x}x$；分部取 $u=f(x)$，$v=x$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $f(1)=0$，$f'(x)=\\dfrac{\\sin x}x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 分部：$\\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx=xf(x)\\Big|_0^1-\\int_0^1x\\cdot\\dfrac{\\sin x}x\\,dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 边界项：$x=1$ 时 $1\\cdot f(1)=0$，$x=0$ 时为 0。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=-\\int_0^1\\sin x\\,dx=\\cos x\\Big|_0^1=\\cos1-1$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"被积函数是写不出来的变限积分 → 分部，让它被求导；$f(1)=0$，$v=x$ 在 0 处为 0，边界项全消。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"7-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $f(x)=\\int_1^{x}e^{t^3}dt$，求 $\\int_0^1xf(x)\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac{1-e}6$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$dv=x\\,dx$，取 $v=\\dfrac{x^2}2$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"剩下 $-\\dfrac12\\int_0^1x^2e^{x^3}dx$，凑微分 $x^2dx=\\frac13d(x^3)$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $f(1)=0$，$f'(x)=e^{x^3}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 分部：$\\int_0^1xf(x)\\,dx=\\dfrac{x^2}2f(x)\\Big|_0^1-\\int_0^1\\dfrac{x^2}2e^{x^3}dx$，边界项为 0。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $\\int_0^1x^2e^{x^3}dx=\\dfrac13e^{x^3}\\Big|_0^1=\\dfrac{e-1}3$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=-\\dfrac12\\cdot\\dfrac{e-1}3=\\dfrac{1-e}6$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"积分里套着积不出来的变限积分 → 分部，$u=f(x)$；$f(1)=0$，$v=\\frac{x^2}2$ 在 0 处为 0。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"7-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x)$ 是周期为 2 的连续奇函数，$x\\in[0,1]$ 时 $f(x)=x(1-x)$。求 $f\\left(\\frac72\\right)$ 和 $\\int_2^5f(x)\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$f\\left(\\frac72\\right)=-\\frac14$，$\\int_2^5f(x)\\,dx=\\frac16$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$\\frac72-4=-\\frac12$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"周期函数在长为一个周期的区间上积分都一样；奇函数在 $[-1,1]$ 上积分为 0。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $f\\left(\\dfrac72\\right)=f\\left(\\dfrac72-4\\right)=f\\left(-\\dfrac12\\right)=-f\\left(\\dfrac12\\right)=-\\dfrac12\\cdot\\dfrac12=-\\dfrac14$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $\\int_2^5=\\int_2^4+\\int_4^5$。$[2,4]$ 长为一个周期，$\\int_2^4f=\\int_{-1}^1f=0$（奇函数）。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $\\int_4^5f(x)\\,dx=\\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx=\\int_0^1(x-x^2)\\,dx=\\dfrac12-\\dfrac13=\\dfrac16$（[[积分:period|周期函数]]）。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $\\int_2^5f(x)\\,dx=\\dfrac16$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"远处的点用周期挪回 $[-1,1]$，负半轴用奇偶翻过来；积分区间按整周期切开。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"7-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $f(x)=\\int_0^{x}\\dfrac{\\sin t}{\\pi-t}\\,dt$，求 $\\int_0^{\\pi}f(x)\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$2$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$f(0)=0$，所以 $v$ 要在 $x=\\pi$ 处为 0：取 $v=x-\\pi$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"剩下 $-\\int_0^\\pi(x-\\pi)\\dfrac{\\sin x}{\\pi-x}dx=\\int_0^\\pi\\sin x\\,dx$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $f(0)=0$，$f'(x)=\\dfrac{\\sin x}{\\pi-x}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 取 $u=f(x)$，$v=x-\\pi$：$\\int_0^\\pi f(x)\\,dx=(x-\\pi)f(x)\\Big|_0^\\pi-\\int_0^\\pi(x-\\pi)\\dfrac{\\sin x}{\\pi-x}dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 边界项：$x=\\pi$ 时 $x-\\pi=0$；$x=0$ 时 $f(0)=0$。边界项为 0。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $(x-\\pi)\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{\\pi-x}=-1$，所以原式 $=\\int_0^\\pi\\sin x\\,dx=-\\cos x\\Big|_0^\\pi=2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"被积函数是写不出来的变限积分 → 分部；$f$ 在下端点 0 处为 0，$v$ 就选在上端点 $\\pi$ 处为 0 的 $x-\\pi$，正好和分母 $\\pi-x$ 约掉。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"$v$ 不一定取 $x$：$v$ 可以是 $x$ 加任何常数，选让边界项消掉、又能和分母约掉的那一个。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2014-10","src":{"year":2014,"no":10,"score":4,"type":"填空"},"type":"填空","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $f(x)$ 是周期为 4 的可导奇函数，且 $f'(x) = 2(x - 1)$，$x \\in [0, 2]$，则 $f(7) =$____。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$1$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"在 $[0,2]$ 上积分得 $f(x)=x^2-2x+C$，用奇函数的性质定 $C$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$7-8=-1$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $x\\in[0,2]$ 时 $f(x)=\\int2(x-1)\\,dx=x^2-2x+C$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 奇函数 $f(0)=0$，所以 $C=0$，$f(x)=x^2-2x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 周期 4：$f(7)=f(7-8)=f(-1)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 奇函数：$f(-1)=-f(1)=-(1-2)=1$。所以 $f(7)=1$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"给 $f'$ 和周期、奇偶求远处的函数值 → 积分得 $f$，$f(0)=0$ 定常数，周期挪回，奇偶翻到正半轴。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2019-13","src":{"year":2019,"no":13,"score":4,"type":"填空"},"type":"填空","q":[{"t":"p","text":"已知函数 $f(x) = x\\int_1^x \\dfrac{\\sin t^2}{t}\\,dt$，则 $\\int_0^1 f(x)\\,dx =$____。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\dfrac{\\cos1-1}4$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"记 $g(x)=\\int_1^x\\dfrac{\\sin t^2}t\\,dt$，$g(1)=0$；原式 $=\\int_0^1xg(x)\\,dx$，分部取 $v=\\frac{x^2}2$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"剩下 $-\\dfrac12\\int_0^1x\\sin x^2\\,dx$，凑微分 $x\\,dx=\\frac12d(x^2)$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 记 $g(x)=\\int_1^x\\dfrac{\\sin t^2}t\\,dt$，$g(1)=0$，$g'(x)=\\dfrac{\\sin x^2}x$。原式 $=\\int_0^1xg(x)\\,dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 分部，$u=g(x)$，$dv=x\\,dx$，$v=\\dfrac{x^2}2$：原式 $=\\dfrac{x^2}2g(x)\\Big|_0^1-\\int_0^1\\dfrac{x^2}2\\cdot\\dfrac{\\sin x^2}x\\,dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 边界项：$x=1$ 时 $g(1)=0$，$x=0$ 时 $\\frac{x^2}2=0$。边界项为 0。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=-\\dfrac12\\int_0^1x\\sin x^2\\,dx=-\\dfrac12\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac12\\cos x^2\\right)\\Big|_0^1=-\\dfrac12\\cdot\\dfrac{1-\\cos1}2=\\dfrac{\\cos1-1}4$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"被积函数里有积不出来的变限积分 → 分部让它被求导；它在上端点 1 处为 0，$v=\\frac{x^2}2$ 在 0 处为 0，边界项全消。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"later","text":"2020 年以后本节考过：2021-14（先交换积分次序再求导，学完第14讲再做）。"},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"被积函数是写不出来的变限积分 → 分部让它当 $u$，求导去掉积分号，$v$ 选得让边界项为 0 → 给 $f'$ 和周期、奇偶求函数值 → 积分得 $f$，奇函数用 $f(0)=0$ 定常数，周期挪回已知区间，负半轴用奇偶翻过来。"}]}]},{"id":"zf","label":"总复习","title":"方法地图 · 题眼 · 混合自测","minutes":50,"kind":"review","blocks":[{"t":"p","text":"这一讲只有一件事：**看到被积函数，先认结构，再选方法**。凑微分、换元、分部、裂项是四种基本方法；分段函数和反常积分只是在它们外面套一层「接常数」「取极限」。"},{"t":"cards","items":[["被积式里有一个函数和它的导数（差常数倍也算）","凑微分，令 $u$ 等于那个函数，换完不许留 $x$"],["$\\frac{\\varphi'}{\\varphi}$、$\\frac{\\varphi'}{1+\\varphi^2}$、$\\frac{\\varphi'}{\\sqrt{1-\\varphi^2}}$","分别积出 $\\ln|\\varphi|$、$\\arctan\\varphi$、$\\arcsin\\varphi$"],["分子一次、分母是不能分解的二次式","分子拆成「分母导数 + 常数」：一项积 $\\ln$，一项配方积 $\\frac1a\\arctan\\frac{x+m}a$"],["有 $\\sqrt[n]{ax+b}$ 或 $\\sqrt{e^x-1}$","令 $t$ 等于整个根号，解出 $x$，求出 $dx$"],["$\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}$、$\\sqrt{a^2+x^2}$、$\\sqrt{x^2-a^2}$","令 $x=a\\sin t$、$a\\tan t$、$a\\sec t$"],["定积分换元","$x$、$dx$、上下限三样一起换，算完不用换回"],["积分区间关于 0 对称","先把奇函数部分划掉，偶函数部分取一半乘 2"],["$\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi2}\\sin^nx\\,dx$","点火公式：从 $\\frac{n-1}n$ 往下乘，偶数最后乘 $\\frac\\pi2$"],["多项式乘 $e^x$ 或三角","分部，多项式当 $u$，几次就分部几次"],["只有一个 $\\ln x$ 或 $\\arctan x$","分部，$dv=dx$"],["$e^x$ 乘 $\\sin x$","两次分部，$u$ 选同一类，出现原积分就移项"],["有理分式","假分式先除 → 分母分解到底 → 按因子设项，先代零点再比系数"],["分母有 $(x-a)^2$","设 $\\frac A{x-a}+\\frac B{(x-a)^2}$ 两项；$\\frac B{(x-a)^2}$ 积出 $-\\frac B{x-a}$"],["分母有不能分解的二次因子","分子设 $Bx+C$，不能只设常数"],["分段函数求原函数","每段积分各带常数，在分段点用连续性接上"],["积分限有 $\\infty$ 或端点无界","先求原函数再取极限；几个 $\\ln$ 合成一个再取极限"],["被积函数是积不出来的变限积分","分部让它当 $u$，选 $v$ 让边界项为 0"],["给 $f'$ 和周期、奇偶，求远处的函数值","积分得 $f$，$f(0)=0$ 定常数，挪回已知区间"]]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^1\\dfrac{x+1}{x^2-2x+2}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac\\pi2-\\frac12\\ln2$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"分母导数 $2x-2$：$x+1=\\frac12(2x-2)+2$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$x^2-2x+2=(x-1)^2+1$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 分母导数 $2x-2$：$x+1=\\dfrac12(2x-2)+2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 第一项：$\\dfrac12\\int_0^1\\dfrac{2x-2}{x^2-2x+2}dx=\\dfrac12\\ln(x^2-2x+2)\\Big|_0^1=\\dfrac12(\\ln1-\\ln2)=-\\dfrac12\\ln2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 第二项：$2\\int_0^1\\dfrac{dx}{(x-1)^2+1}=2\\arctan(x-1)\\Big|_0^1=2\\left[0-\\left(-\\dfrac\\pi4\\right)\\right]=\\dfrac\\pi2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=\\dfrac\\pi2-\\dfrac12\\ln2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"分子一次、分母判别式 $4-8<0$ 不能分解 → 分子拆成「分母导数的倍数 + 常数」，一项 $\\ln$，一项配方 $\\arctan$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"1"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_{-1}^{1}\\dfrac{x^2+\\sin x}{1+\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$2-\\frac\\pi2$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$\\dfrac{\\sin x}{1+\\sqrt{1-x^2}}$ 是奇函数。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$\\dfrac{x^2}{1+\\sqrt{1-x^2}}$ 分子分母同乘 $1-\\sqrt{1-x^2}$，化成 $1-\\sqrt{1-x^2}$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $\\sin x$ 是奇函数，$1+\\sqrt{1-x^2}$ 是偶函数，商是奇函数，积分为 0。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 剩下的 $\\dfrac{x^2}{1+\\sqrt{1-x^2}}$ 是偶函数：原式 $=2\\int_0^1\\dfrac{x^2}{1+\\sqrt{1-x^2}}dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 分母有理化：$\\dfrac{x^2\\left(1-\\sqrt{1-x^2}\\right)}{1-(1-x^2)}=1-\\sqrt{1-x^2}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $\\int_0^1\\sqrt{1-x^2}\\,dx$ 是四分之一个单位圆的面积，等于 $\\dfrac\\pi4$（[[积分:circ|圆的面积]]）。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 原式 $=2\\left(1-\\dfrac\\pi4\\right)=2-\\dfrac\\pi2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"对称区间 → 先划掉奇函数部分；偶函数部分有根号在分母，分母有理化后变成 $1-\\sqrt{1-x^2}$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"2"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi4}\\dfrac{x}{\\cos^2x}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac\\pi4-\\frac12\\ln2$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$\\dfrac{dx}{\\cos^2x}=d(\\tan x)$；$u=x$，$v=\\tan x$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int\\tan x\\,dx=-\\ln|\\cos x|+C$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $u=x$，$dv=\\sec^2x\\,dx$，$v=\\tan x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 原式 $=x\\tan x\\Big|_0^{\\frac\\pi4}-\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi4}\\tan x\\,dx=\\dfrac\\pi4-\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi4}\\tan x\\,dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi4}\\tan x\\,dx=-\\ln\\cos x\\Big|_0^{\\frac\\pi4}=-\\ln\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}2=\\dfrac12\\ln2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=\\dfrac\\pi4-\\dfrac12\\ln2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"多项式 $x$ 乘 $\\sec^2x$（$\\sec^2x$ 能积出 $\\tan x$）→ 分部，$x$ 当 $u$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"3"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^1\\dfrac{x^2+2}{(x+1)(x^2+1)}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac54\\ln2+\\frac\\pi8$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"设 $\\dfrac A{x+1}+\\dfrac{Bx+C}{x^2+1}$；代 $x=-1$ 得 $A=\\frac32$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"比较 $x^2$ 系数和常数项：$B=-\\frac12$，$C=\\frac12$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 两边乘分母：$x^2+2=A(x^2+1)+(Bx+C)(x+1)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 代 $x=-1$：$3=2A$，$A=\\dfrac32$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 比较 $x^2$ 系数：$1=A+B$，$B=-\\dfrac12$。常数项：$2=A+C$，$C=\\dfrac12$。验算 $x$ 的系数：$B+C=0$，对。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=\\int_0^1\\left(\\dfrac{3/2}{x+1}-\\dfrac12\\cdot\\dfrac{x}{x^2+1}+\\dfrac12\\cdot\\dfrac1{x^2+1}\\right)dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 逐项：$\\dfrac32\\ln(x+1)\\Big|_0^1=\\dfrac32\\ln2$；$-\\dfrac14\\ln(x^2+1)\\Big|_0^1=-\\dfrac14\\ln2$；$\\dfrac12\\arctan x\\Big|_0^1=\\dfrac\\pi8$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑥ 原式 $=\\dfrac32\\ln2-\\dfrac14\\ln2+\\dfrac\\pi8=\\dfrac54\\ln2+\\dfrac\\pi8$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"一个一次因子、一个不能分解的二次因子 → 一次因子设 $\\frac A{x+1}$，二次因子分子设 $Bx+C$；拆完逐项积分。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"4"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p5","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x)=\\begin{cases}x^2,&x\\le0,\\\\\\sin x,&x>0,\\end{cases}$ 求 $f$ 的满足 $F(\\pi)=1$ 的原函数 $F(x)$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$F(x)=\\begin{cases}\\frac{x^3}3-1,&x\\le0,\\\\-\\cos x,&x>0\\end{cases}$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"右段 $-\\cos x+C_2$，用 $F(\\pi)=1$ 定 $C_2$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"右段在 0 处趋于 $-1$，左段 $\\frac{x^3}3+C_1$ 在 0 处要等于它。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 左段：$\\int x^2dx=\\dfrac{x^3}3+C_1$；右段：$\\int\\sin x\\,dx=-\\cos x+C_2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $F(\\pi)=1$：$-\\cos\\pi+C_2=1+C_2=1$，$C_2=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 0 处连续：右段 $x\\to0^+$ 时 $\\to-1$；左段 $F(0)=C_1$。所以 $C_1=-1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $F(x)=\\dfrac{x^3}3-1$（$x\\le0$），$F(x)=-\\cos x$（$x>0$）。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"分段函数求原函数 → 每段积分各带常数；题给的 $F(\\pi)$ 在右段，先定右段，再用 0 处连续定左段。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"5"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p6","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{x(x^2+1)}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac12\\ln2$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$\\dfrac1{x(x^2+1)}=\\dfrac1x-\\dfrac{x}{x^2+1}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"原函数合成 $\\ln\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}$ 再取极限。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 设 $\\dfrac1{x(x^2+1)}=\\dfrac Ax+\\dfrac{Bx+C}{x^2+1}$，$1=A(x^2+1)+(Bx+C)x$。代 $x=0$：$A=1$；$x^2$ 系数 $A+B=0$，$B=-1$；$x$ 系数 $C=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 原函数：$\\ln x-\\dfrac12\\ln(x^2+1)=\\ln\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $x\\to+\\infty$：$\\dfrac x{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}\\to1$，原函数 $\\to0$。$x=1$：$\\ln\\dfrac1{\\sqrt2}=-\\dfrac12\\ln2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=0-\\left(-\\dfrac12\\ln2\\right)=\\dfrac12\\ln2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"无穷限、有理函数 → 裂项求原函数；两个 $\\ln$ 合成一个再在 $+\\infty$ 取极限。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"6"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p7","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^{+\\infty}x^3e^{-x^2}\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\frac12$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"令 $t=x^2$，$x^3dx=\\frac12t\\,dt$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"变成 $\\dfrac12\\int_0^{+\\infty}te^{-t}dt$，再分部。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 令 $t=x^2$，$dt=2x\\,dx$，$x^3dx=x^2\\cdot x\\,dx=\\dfrac12t\\,dt$；$t$ 从 0 到 $+\\infty$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 原式 $=\\dfrac12\\int_0^{+\\infty}te^{-t}dt$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 分部：$\\int te^{-t}dt=-(t+1)e^{-t}+C$；$t\\to+\\infty$ 时 $\\to0$，$t=0$ 时为 $-1$。$\\int_0^{+\\infty}te^{-t}dt=1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=\\dfrac12$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"指数上是 $x^2$，前面有 $x^3=x^2\\cdot x$ → 换元 $t=x^2$ 把它变成多项式乘指数，再分部；无穷限最后取极限。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"6"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p8","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $f(x)=\\int_1^{x}\\dfrac{\\ln(1+t)}{t}\\,dt$，求 $\\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$1-2\\ln2$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$f(1)=0$，$f'(x)=\\dfrac{\\ln(1+x)}x$；分部取 $v=x$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"剩下 $-\\int_0^1\\ln(1+x)\\,dx$，再分部一次。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $f(1)=0$，$f'(x)=\\dfrac{\\ln(1+x)}x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 分部：$\\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx=xf(x)\\Big|_0^1-\\int_0^1x\\cdot\\dfrac{\\ln(1+x)}x\\,dx=0-\\int_0^1\\ln(1+x)\\,dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 再分部，$dv=dx$，取 $v=1+x$：$\\int_0^1\\ln(1+x)\\,dx=(1+x)\\ln(1+x)\\Big|_0^1-\\int_0^1dx=2\\ln2-1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=-(2\\ln2-1)=1-2\\ln2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"被积函数是积不出来的变限积分 → 分部让它被求导；$f(1)=0$，$v=x$ 在 0 处为 0，边界项全消；剩下的 $\\ln(1+x)$ 再分部。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"7"}]}]}